    "northStar": "Tour Notes",
    "overview": "Purposeful band planning with precise date columns, calm green-grey surfaces and petrol panels. Coral gives performances their own emphasis. The tone is friendly and direct, with German copy and people identified by names and instruments.\n\nThis documents the implemented development-only `/prototype` surface and `src/components/design-demo.tsx` on Expo SDK 58. It does not restyle the legacy authenticated app. Values were extracted from source; native visual verification is pending.",
